areness, Deadzone Aiming & minimal UI help create a gripping and atmospheric experience.\nUPGRADE: Discover modules that unlock new functionality for the Cosmonaut Assistance Tool (C.A.T.)\nSURVIVE: Run, hide, or attempt to defend yourself using the C.A.T. as a last resort."}